{"seq":1,"slug":"crewai","title":"CrewAI 多代理协作","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-agent-frameworks/multi-agent-frameworks/crewai","wordCount":989,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"crewai-多代理协作\">CrewAI 多代理协作</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>CrewAI 是一个面向多代理协作的框架，它的核心理念是将 AI 应用类比为一个团队（Crew）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"角色驱动的设计\">角色驱动的设计</h3><ul>\n<li>每个 Agent 扮演特定角色（Role），拥有明确的目标（Goal）和背景故事（Backstory）</li>\n<li>多个 Agent 通过协作完成复杂任务</li>\n<li>这种角色驱动的设计使得非技术人员也能理解和设计 Agent 系统</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[研究员 Agent]--&gt;|研究报告|D[任务队列]&#10;    B[分析师 Agent]--&gt;|分析结果|D&#10;    C[写作者 Agent]--&gt;|最终文档|D&#10;    D--&gt;E{流程管理器}&#10;    E--&gt;|顺序执行|F[Sequential]&#10;    E--&gt;|层级管理|G[Hierarchical]&#10;    E--&gt;|自主协商|H[Consensual]\">flowchart TD\n    A[研究员 Agent]--&gt;|研究报告|D[任务队列]\n    B[分析师 Agent]--&gt;|分析结果|D\n    C[写作者 Agent]--&gt;|最终文档|D\n    D--&gt;E{流程管理器}\n    E--&gt;|顺序执行|F[Sequential]\n    E--&gt;|层级管理|G[Hierarchical]\n    E--&gt;|自主协商|H[Consensual]</pre><h3 id=\"框架横向对比\">框架横向对比</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>CrewAI</th>\n<th>LangGraph</th>\n<th>AutoGen</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>核心抽象</td>\n<td>角色驱动的 Agent</td>\n<td>状态图节点</td>\n<td>对话式 Agent</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>任务编排</td>\n<td>自动流程管理</td>\n<td>手动图构建</td>\n<td>消息传递</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>学习曲线</td>\n<td>低（声明式）</td>\n<td>中（图概念）</td>\n<td>中（协议理解）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>灵活性</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n<td>最高</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>人工介入</td>\n<td>内置</td>\n<td>内置</td>\n<td>需自定义</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>生产就绪</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"agent-角色定义\">Agent 角色定义</h2><ul>\n<li>CrewAI 的 Agent 由三个核心属性定义</li>\n<li>这种设计让 LLM 能够更好地进入角色</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"三元组属性\">三元组属性</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>属性</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Role</td>\n<td>决定 Agent 的专业身份</td>\n<td>高级技术研究员</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Goal</td>\n<td>描述要达成的目标</td>\n<td>产出全面准确的研究报告</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Backstory</td>\n<td>提供行为上下文</td>\n<td>10 年经验、以深度和准确性著称</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"定义示例\">定义示例</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const researcher = new Agent({&#10;  role: &#39;高级技术研究员&#39;,&#10;  goal: &#39;产出准确的研究报告&#39;,&#10;  backstory: &#39;资深研究员&#39;,&#10;  allowDelegation: true,&#10;  tools: researchTools,&#10;  llm: &#39;gpt-4-turbo&#39;,&#10;  maxIterations: 15,&#10;  memory: true,&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> researcher</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Agent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  role: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'高级技术研究员'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  goal: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'产出准确的研究报告'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  backstory: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'资深研究员'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  allowDelegation: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  tools: researchTools,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  llm: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'gpt-4-turbo'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  maxIterations: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">15</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  memory: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><p>同一团队中还可以定义其他角色，各自携带独立的 Role/Goal/Backstory：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>数据分析专家（配 <code>calculatorTool</code>、<code>chartTool</code>）</li>\n<li>技术文档撰写者（配 <code>markdownTool</code>）</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"职责单一原则\">职责单一原则</h3><p>角色设计的关键是<strong>职责单一</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>设计</th>\n<th>效果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>职责单一</td>\n<td>每个 Agent 专注一个明确的功能领域</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>职责宽泛</td>\n<td>LLM 表现往往不如多个专注的 Agent 协作</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"任务编排与流程\">任务编排与流程</h2><p>Task 是 CrewAI 中工作的基本单位：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>每个 Task 描述了要完成的具体工作、期望输出和分配的 Agent</li>\n<li>Crew 则定义了任务的执行流程</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"task-的关键字段\">Task 的关键字段</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>字段</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>description</code></td>\n<td>要完成的具体工作（可含模板）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>expectedOutput</code></td>\n<td>期望输出的形态描述</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>agent</code></td>\n<td>分配执行的 Agent</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>context</code></td>\n<td>依赖的上游任务列表</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>outputFile</code></td>\n<td>结果落盘路径</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"组装-crew-并启动\">组装 Crew 并启动</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const analysisTask = new Task({&#10;  description: &#39;基于研究报告做对比&#39;,&#10;  expectedOutput: &#39;含表格的分析报告&#39;,&#10;  agent: dataAnalyst,&#10;  context: [researchTask],&#10;});&#10;const crew = new Crew({&#10;  agents: team,&#10;  tasks: allTasks,&#10;  process: Process.Sequential,&#10;  memory: true,&#10;  planning: true,&#10;});&#10;await crew.kickoff(inputs);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> analysisTask</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Task</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  description: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'基于研究报告做对比'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  expectedOutput: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'含表格的分析报告'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  agent: dataAnalyst,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  context: [researchTask],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> crew</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Crew</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  agents: team,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  tasks: allTasks,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  process: Process.Sequential,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  memory: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  planning: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> crew.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">kickoff</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(inputs);</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"三种流程类型\">三种流程类型</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>流程类型</th>\n<th>执行方式</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>优势</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Sequential</td>\n<td>按顺序逐个执行</td>\n<td>有依赖关系的任务链</td>\n<td>简单可控</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Hierarchical</td>\n<td>管理者 Agent 分配任务</td>\n<td>复杂多步骤项目</td>\n<td>灵活调度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Consensual</td>\n<td>Agent 间协商决策</td>\n<td>需要多视角决策</td>\n<td>结果更全面</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"记忆与学习机制\">记忆与学习机制</h2><ul>\n<li>CrewAI 的记忆系统分三个层次</li>\n<li>使 Agent 能够从历史执行中学习和改进</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"三层记忆\">三层记忆</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>记忆层次</th>\n<th>内容</th>\n<th>生命周期</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>短期记忆</td>\n<td>当前任务上下文</td>\n<td>单次运行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>长期记忆</td>\n<td>跨次运行的经验</td>\n<td>持久化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>实体记忆</td>\n<td>关键信息索引</td>\n<td>持久化</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"启用记忆\">启用记忆</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const crewWithMemory = new Crew({&#10;  agents,&#10;  tasks,&#10;  memory: true,&#10;  embeddingModel: {&#10;    provider: &#39;openai&#39;,&#10;    config: {&#10;      model: &#39;text-embedding-3-small&#39;,&#10;    },&#10;  },&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> crewWithMemory</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Crew</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  agents,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  tasks,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  memory: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  embeddingModel: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    provider: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'openai'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    config: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      model: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'text-embedding-3-small'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"跨运行学习\">跨运行学习</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[执行任务]--&gt;B[经验写入向量库]&#10;    B--&gt;C[下次任务自动检索]&#10;    C--&gt;D[团队越用越准]&#10;    D--&gt;A\">flowchart TD\n    A[执行任务]--&gt;B[经验写入向量库]\n    B--&gt;C[下次任务自动检索]\n    C--&gt;D[团队越用越准]\n    D--&gt;A</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>环节</th>\n<th>机制</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>存储</td>\n<td>长期记忆通过向量数据库存储</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>检索</td>\n<td>执行新任务时自动检索相关的历史经验</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>效果</td>\n<td>Agent 团队随使用次数增加而更高效、更准确</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"生产化与监控\">生产化与监控</h2><p>将 CrewAI 部署到生产环境需要关注：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>异步执行</li>\n<li>错误恢复</li>\n<li>性能监控</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"生产配置要点\">生产配置要点</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>配置项</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>maxRpm</code></td>\n<td>速率限制，防止超出配额</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>stepCallback</code></td>\n<td>逐步回调，记录 Agent 状态</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>taskCallback</code></td>\n<td>任务级回调，记录完成与评分</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>managerLlm</code></td>\n<td>Hierarchical 流程的管理模型</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const productionCrew = new Crew({&#10;  agents,&#10;  tasks,&#10;  process: Process.Hierarchical,&#10;  managerLlm: &#39;gpt-4-turbo&#39;,&#10;  maxRpm: 10,&#10;  stepCallback: logStep,&#10;  taskCallback: logTask,&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> productionCrew</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Crew</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  agents,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  tasks,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  process: Process.Hierarchical,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  managerLlm: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'gpt-4-turbo'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  maxRpm: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  stepCallback: logStep,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  taskCallback: logTask,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"超时控制\">超时控制</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const runWithTimeout = async (crew, inputs, ms) =&gt; {&#10;  const controller = new AbortController();&#10;  const timer = setTimeout(() =&gt; controller.abort(), ms);&#10;  try {&#10;    const result = await crew.kickoff({ inputs });&#10;    return { success: true, result };&#10;  } finally {&#10;    clearTimeout(timer);&#10;  }&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> runWithTimeout</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> async</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">crew</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">inputs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">ms</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> controller</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> AbortController</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> timer</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> setTimeout</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> controller.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">abort</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(), ms);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  try</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> result</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> crew.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">kickoff</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ inputs });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { success: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, result };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">finally</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    clearTimeout</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(timer);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>CrewAI 以角色驱动的方式定义 Agent，通过 Role、Goal、Backstory 三元组实现角色化</li>\n<li>任务编排支持顺序、层级和协商三种流程，通过 context 属性建立任务间依赖</li>\n<li>记忆系统包含短期、长期和实体三个层次，使 Agent 能从历史执行中学习</li>\n<li>生产部署需要关注超时控制、速率限制、回调监控和错误恢复机制</li>\n<li>适合结构化的多步骤任务（如研究报告、内容生产），不适合需要高度灵活性的实时交互场景</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"CrewAI 多代理协作","id":"crewai-多代理协作"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":3,"text":"角色驱动的设计","id":"角色驱动的设计"},{"level":3,"text":"框架横向对比","id":"框架横向对比"},{"level":2,"text":"Agent 角色定义","id":"agent-角色定义"},{"level":3,"text":"三元组属性","id":"三元组属性"},{"level":3,"text":"定义示例","id":"定义示例"},{"level":3,"text":"职责单一原则","id":"职责单一原则"},{"level":2,"text":"任务编排与流程","id":"任务编排与流程"},{"level":3,"text":"Task 的关键字段","id":"task-的关键字段"},{"level":3,"text":"组装 Crew 并启动","id":"组装-crew-并启动"},{"level":3,"text":"三种流程类型","id":"三种流程类型"},{"level":2,"text":"记忆与学习机制","id":"记忆与学习机制"},{"level":3,"text":"三层记忆","id":"三层记忆"},{"level":3,"text":"启用记忆","id":"启用记忆"},{"level":3,"text":"跨运行学习","id":"跨运行学习"},{"level":2,"text":"生产化与监控","id":"生产化与监控"},{"level":3,"text":"生产配置要点","id":"生产配置要点"},{"level":3,"text":"超时控制","id":"超时控制"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"LangGraph 状态化工作流","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-agent-frameworks/langchain-ecosystem/langgraph"},"next":{"title":"AutoGen 对话式多代理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-agent-frameworks/multi-agent-frameworks/autogen"}}